file=Ops & Delivery/pace/operational/principles/pace-principles.md · p·p:pace \· principles=> Universal-only.\n\n1. **Per-team, never comparative.** Velocity is a system property, not a person / team ranking.\n2. **Median + P90 over mean** for cycle time (skewed distributions).\n3. **Ranges, not points** for delivery forecasts.\n4. **Every forecast cites history depth + assumptions.**\n5. **Never a promise** — a forecast is a distribution.\n6. **Material shifts flag**, not judge.\n7. **Systemic shift → flow** for root cause.\n8. **Provenance:** `[tracker export date]`.\n9. **Retro items tracked**, never discarded.\n10. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n